      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Key Service Provider**\n\nOkay, I've decided to move forward with Google Cloud KMS as the managed key service provider. Now, the main thrust of my current thinking revolves around integrating this choice into the `envelope_encrypt.py` script. The goal is to make KMS clearly identifiable within the code.\n\n\n**Implementing Cloud KMS Integration**\n\nI'm now writing the `envelope_encrypt.py` script and starting with the structure. I've imported the Google Cloud KMS client and will set up its configuration. Next, I'll flesh out the functions for encryption and decryption. The integration logic for KMS will be implemented within those functions.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789868055801,
          "start": 1789868048432
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc730030001L69UaWjkLuh4uG",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc72fb78001xLejDAVxy3XGPn",
